{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists","id":768054,"title":"[EX3] Abyssal antagonists","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-17T13:24:25-08:00","id":768054,"title":"[EX3] Abyssal antagonists","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> I'm preparing an Exalted 3E campaign set in the East, and as such, some the Mask of Winter's Abyssals are likely to play a recurring role in my series. Unfortunately, the 3E corebook doesn't really tell us anything system-wise for Abyssals.<br /> <br /> Any advice on handling this, besides trying to adapt myself bits and pieces of the 2.5E Abyssals splat?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9458-boz0","name":"boz0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9458_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T14:55:29-08:00","id":768123,"title":"","content":"Base lower-level Charms on Solar effects, made appropriately spooky and ghostly. Base Charms beyond that on Deathlord capabilities, such as summoning soulsteel armor that bolts itself onto the character, being able to frostily blight a small circle of terrain, having combat tentacles that look like anemones and have... other purposes...<br /> <br /> Maybe not so much the last one, but it is your game. Curse you, Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T15:06:25-08:00","id":768127,"title":"","content":"Spookify Solar Charms, add in some ghost-summoning and Intimacy-weakening, and you should be good to fake it until the Abyssal book comes along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T19:00:51-08:00","id":768231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Holden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768127#post768127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spookify Solar Charms, add in some ghost-summoning and Intimacy-weakening, and you should be good to fake it until the Abyssal book comes along.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, Any suggestions for converting Seamstress in my game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T23:03:17-08:00","id":768297,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the advice.<br /> Any idea as to when that Abyssal book is planned for? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9458-boz0","name":"boz0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9458_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T18:38:01-08:00","id":768832,"title":"","content":"My guess is that the schedule is going to look something like this: 2 splats a year.<br /> <br /> 2016: DBs Q1-2, Exigents Q3-4<br /> 2017: Lunars Q1-2, New Exalt Type Q3-4<br /> 2018: Sidereals Q1-2, Getimians Q3-4<br /> 2019: Abyssals Q1-2, Liminals Q3-4<br /> <br /> I could see Sids and Lunars being switched around and, depending on who gets a fatsplat and who doesn't, they might be able to jam Lunars and Sidereals into one year, but I really wouldn't count on Abyssals being the next splat after Exigents (mostly because you can fake an Abyssal pretty well by creating a Goth Solar, as has been noted), so 2018 or 2019 seems like a good estimate.<br /> <br /> [sarcasm]Of course, given the way the game has been going, something will happen that delays everything another 5 years.[/sarcasm] *knocks wood*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T22:14:48-08:00","id":768967,"title":"","content":"Given how popular they are and importance as villains to the plot line, I would think say they hit before Lunar. They are the second most notorious enemy after dragon blooded, After Abyssal I see Lunar coming so my guess is Abyssal then Liminal, then Sidereal, Getmain, then Lunar and then their counter, Thus getting us into the unknown area and keeping a sort of pairing going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T22:56:55-08:00","id":768982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768967#post768967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how popular they are and importance as villains to the plot line, I would think say they hit before Lunar. They are the second most notorious enemy after dragon blooded, After Abyssal I see Lunar coming so my guess is Abyssal then Liminal, then Sidereal, Getmain, then Lunar and then their counter, Thus getting us into the unknown area and keeping a sort of pairing going.</div> </div> </div> </div>I doubt that's a concern for release order. Especially not when you can make Spooky Solar Charms as a stopgap for quite a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T03:35:10-08:00","id":769077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768832#post768832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2016: DBs Q1-2, Exigents Q3-4<br /> 2017: Lunars Q1-2, New Exalt Type Q3-4<br /> 2018: Sidereals Q1-2, Getimians Q3-4<br /> 2019: Abyssals Q1-2, Liminals Q3-4</div> </div> </div> </div> <b><i>MALFEAS RAGES AT THIS LACK OF REPRESENTATION!</i></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T03:58:50-08:00","id":769089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=769077#post769077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <b><i>MALFEAS RAGES AT THIS LACK OF REPRESENTATION!</i></b></div> </div> </div> </div>Should have thought about that before he lost the war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Known elsewhere as Kurulham. Void where permitted.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/d34vnu2hx0ifmk5/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4277-jackson-mackenzie","name":"Jackson MacKenzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T07:43:11-08:00","id":769232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768967#post768967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how popular they are and importance as villains to the plot line, I would think say they hit before Lunar. They are the second most notorious enemy after dragon blooded, After Abyssal I see Lunar coming so my guess is Abyssal then Liminal, then Sidereal, Getmain, then Lunar and then their counter, Thus getting us into the unknown area and keeping a sort of pairing going.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand the need to get The Realm out as soon as possible, especially with the enlarged Creation<br /> I get the Dragon-Blooded splat, which can serve to make both compelling NPCs and a DB-based game.<br /> Arms of the Chosen doesn't seem all that urgent to me, but that might just be me.<br /> <br /> However, I feel that what we mostly need right now is a 3E Storyteller's Companion, not a splat for another species of Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9458-boz0","name":"boz0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9458_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T08:02:55-08:00","id":769251,"title":"","content":"They said they're not doing a Storyteller's Companion.<br /> <br /> As much \u200bas I enjoyed reading the old Storyteller's Companion for seeing what different splats were going to be like before their books were written (especially in 1e), they weren't actually that useful.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T17:17:49-08:00","id":770391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Holden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768127#post768127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spookify Solar Charms, add in some ghost-summoning and Intimacy-weakening, and you should be good to fake it until the Abyssal book comes along.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd assume the same applied for PC Abyssals if someone really wanted to do a redemption-to-Solar story in 3e, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T17:44:31-08:00","id":770405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>boz0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=769232#post769232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, I feel that what we mostly need right now is a 3E Storyteller's Companion, not a splat for another species of Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Keep in mind that Exigents is going to include help and advice on creating charms and charmsets, so in some ways it serves some of the same purposes a Storyteller's Companion would anyways.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/91-wandering","name":"Wandering","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar91_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T17:58:03-08:00","id":770415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768982#post768982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I doubt that's a concern for release order. Especially not when you can make Spooky Solar Charms as a stopgap for quite a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, with the core done, all Solaroids can be successfully faked. Lunars and Siderials... not so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2050-dawngreeter","name":"Dawngreeter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2050_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T20:30:21-08:00","id":770488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>horngeek</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=770391#post770391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'd assume the same applied for PC Abyssals if someone really wanted to do a redemption-to-Solar story in 3e, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Or just a regular Abyssal story.<br /> I told my players they could play Solars, or, if they really wanted, Abyssals, in 3rd ed. All you really have to convert is Resonance (which I assume will work completely differently in 3rd ed anyway), for the charms just change the thematic.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T20:33:55-08:00","id":770489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=768832#post768832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My guess is that the schedule is going to look something like this: 2 splats a year.<br /> <br /> 2016: DBs Q1-2, Exigents Q3-4<br /> 2017: Lunars Q1-2, New Exalt Type Q3-4<br /> 2018: Sidereals Q1-2, Getimians Q3-4<br /> 2019: Abyssals Q1-2, Liminals Q3-4</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, they'll never get around to releasing the Core. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T21:36:01-08:00","id":770521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/768054-ex3-abyssal-antagonists?p=770488#post770488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or just a regular Abyssal story.<br /> I told my players they could play Solars, or, if they really wanted, Abyssals, in 3rd ed. All you really have to convert is Resonance (which I assume will work completely differently in 3rd ed anyway), for the charms just change the thematic.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm talking about what I'd be interested in playing, though. Abyssals absolutely don't interest me played straight/'regular' (at least as a PC option) even in the new, cool form 3e gives us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T22:05:57-08:00","id":770537,"title":"","content":"Oh, fair enough. \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}